        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Length. Natural cotton tabby ground, printed with copperplates in brown. Pattern shows undulating and crossing stalks bearing pointed, serrated leaves and fantastic blossoms. Interspaces show islands with trees and Chinese figures. Both selvedges present; each contains pale blue yarns. Much stained; in several places brown dye has rotted fabric."@en ;
